3575
04:19:27,760 --> 04:19:28,400
Oh, that's scary.

3576
04:19:28,580 --> 04:19:29,460
I got to blow that up.

3577
04:19:39,140 --> 04:19:43,540
It is kind of risky to dig through snow like that because sometimes there's a propane tank embedded in the snow.

3578
