3584
04:20:14,540 --> 04:20:15,460
Oh, look at all that meat.

3585
04:20:17,100 --> 04:20:17,420
Yes.

3586
04:20:28,990 --> 04:20:29,290
Good.

3587
04:20:30,270 --> 04:20:31,050
