3611
04:21:57,660 --> 04:21:57,840
Jesus.

3612
04:21:59,320 --> 04:22:00,800
Oh, yes!

3613
04:22:02,280 --> 04:22:03,800
Thank you, Mr. President.

3614
04:22:09,240 --> 04:22:11,680
Oh my god, the blood here is wild.

3615
04:22:12,620 --> 04:22:12,840
Pheromone!

3616
