3621
04:22:40,420 --> 04:22:41,860
Just find the lights, I guess.

3622
04:22:47,310 --> 04:22:49,150
Yeah, it's going to be a hell to find, isn't it?

3623
04:22:54,450 --> 04:22:55,290
What do we got here?

3624
04:22:58,360 --> 04:23:01,240
It's actually safer to dig like this in the snow.

3625
04:23:03,620 --> 04:23:05,800
