3628
04:23:31,580 --> 04:23:33,320
I have no clue where that bar was.

3629
04:23:36,220 --> 04:23:37,740
Wait, you're not dying to the...

3630
04:23:40,520 --> 04:23:40,960
What?

3631
04:23:41,520 --> 04:23:43,340
He took no damage from the drill.

3632
04:23:45,700 --> 04:23:46,420
That's weird.

3633
04:23:54,290 --> 04:23:54,690
Okay.

3634
04:23:58,010 --> 04:23:59,090
More hearts, please.

3635
04:24:01,170 --> 04:24:03,830
