3647
04:25:22,640 --> 04:25:23,980
This is the top layer.

3648
04:25:30,680 --> 04:25:32,420
I think I might just give up on finding that bar.

3649
04:25:34,800 --> 04:25:35,480
It's over.

3650
04:25:36,300 --> 04:25:38,180
That thing is lost to the ether.

3651
04:25:48,340 --> 04:25:49,140
Go through.

3652
