3663
04:26:41,240 --> 04:26:42,120
Weakening curse explosives.

3664
04:26:42,300 --> 04:26:42,820
I have that already.

3665
04:26:55,080 --> 04:26:56,780
Now, let's be careful still.

3666
04:27:00,540 --> 04:27:02,340
This is how you explore the dark areas.

3667
04:27:02,480 --> 04:27:03,680
