3674
04:27:25,570 --> 04:27:26,790
This is the same damage as before.

3675
04:27:32,540 --> 04:27:32,980
Right.

3676
04:27:35,120 --> 04:27:36,500
Oh yeah, that is the guy I damaged earlier.

3677
04:27:36,640 --> 04:27:38,080
