3687
04:28:28,910 --> 04:28:29,910
Oh, I remember this spot.

3688
04:28:30,130 --> 04:28:30,510
I remember this.

3689
04:28:33,530 --> 04:28:36,090
I think I went back because of the clouds, right?

3690
04:28:37,930 --> 04:28:39,230
Yeah, that's it.

3691
04:28:41,750 --> 04:28:42,610
Perfect timing.

3692
04:28:44,170 --> 04:28:47,510
You know, they're not actually that bad.

3693
04:28:48,150 --> 04:28:51,550
Like, my permanent shield is doing wonders here.

3694
04:28:58,510 --> 04:28:59,550
