3701
04:29:22,680 --> 04:29:23,560
Oh, twitchy.

3702
04:29:26,200 --> 04:29:27,540
I'm gonna make a little shooting hole.

3703
04:29:28,280 --> 04:29:28,800
Oh, shit.

3704
04:29:35,640 --> 04:29:36,560
Burn away the poison.

3705
04:29:37,140 --> 04:29:38,000
Shit, there's poison everywhere.

3706
04:29:40,080 --> 04:29:41,280
