3711
04:29:59,480 --> 04:30:00,140
Oh, shit.

3712
04:30:03,820 --> 04:30:04,480
Got him.

3713
04:30:08,660 --> 04:30:10,200
Look at all the poison below me.

3714
04:30:21,920 --> 04:30:23,440
Oh, no, it's those guys.

3715
04:30:24,280 --> 04:30:25,300
What are they doing here?

3716
04:30:27,380 --> 04:30:28,180
Fuck off.

3717
04:30:31,540 --> 04:30:32,180
Are you scared of me?

3718
04:30:34,540 --> 04:30:35,900
One of them is down, nice.

3719
04:30:42,380 --> 04:30:42,940
Uh-oh.

3720
04:30:44,120 --> 04:30:45,900
Kill that dude immediately.

3721
04:30:48,180 --> 04:30:49,260
Shit, shit, shit, shit, shit, shit.

3722
04:30:53,060 --> 04:30:53,700
Come here.

3723
04:30:55,540 --> 04:30:56,400
There we go.

3724
04:30:56,640 --> 04:30:57,400
They're not that bad.

3725
04:30:58,000 --> 04:30:58,460
It's okay.

3726
04:30:58,820 --> 04:30:59,060
It's okay.

3727
04:31:05,650 --> 04:31:05,750
Wait.

3728
04:31:08,230 --> 04:31:08,670
Teleportation.

3729
04:31:09,530 --> 04:31:11,210
I kind of wanted to do experiments with that.

3730
04:31:12,050 --> 04:31:13,890
But there's not enough of it, I think.

3731
04:31:14,510 --> 04:31:16,870
If anything, I would like to have a full bottle of it.

3732
04:31:18,430 --> 04:31:19,530
Where'd the other spider go?

3733
04:31:22,470 --> 04:31:23,710
I'm in deep water here.

3734
04:31:31,270 --> 04:31:33,330
Do not run into spaces you haven't been before.

3735
04:31:33,470 --> 04:31:34,970
So let's just clear a little path here.

3736
04:31:35,050 --> 04:31:36,130
Oh, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.

3737
04:31:36,210 --> 04:31:37,010
Okay, so we're back here now.

3738
04:31:37,150 --> 04:31:37,210
Perfect.

3739
04:31:41,960 --> 04:31:42,440
Come here.

3740
04:31:43,660 --> 04:31:44,380
Come here, damn it.

3741
04:31:53,750 --> 04:31:54,270
Come on.

3742
04:31:59,950 --> 04:32:00,810
There we go.

3743
04:32:02,130 --> 04:32:02,790
Down with you.

3744
04:32:04,690 --> 04:32:06,710
