3750
04:32:30,060 --> 04:32:30,820
Oh, maybe he was.

3751
04:32:32,060 --> 04:32:32,460
Freezing vapor.

3752
04:32:34,000 --> 04:32:35,240
Maybe that's the way to kill them.

3753
04:32:35,860 --> 04:32:36,560
Like, properly.

3754
04:32:38,120 --> 04:32:38,520
Just...

3755
04:32:38,520 --> 04:32:38,980
What the...

3756
04:32:41,420 --> 04:32:41,820
Hello?

3757
04:32:44,040 --> 04:32:45,080
What the fuck is this?

3758
04:32:49,240 --> 04:32:50,060
What is that place?

3759
04:32:52,940 --> 04:32:54,060
Oh, my God.

3760
04:32:54,580 --> 04:32:55,260
