3761
04:32:57,700 --> 04:32:58,640
Oh, it's this thing.

3762
04:33:00,940 --> 04:33:01,300
Hello?

3763
04:33:04,500 --> 04:33:06,620
He shot some kind of bullshit.

3764
04:33:10,720 --> 04:33:12,040
Oh, it's dark in here, man.

3765
04:33:13,840 --> 04:33:14,820
It's like the Wizards then.

3766
04:33:20,170 --> 04:33:20,810
Sweet, what?

3767
04:33:24,560 --> 04:33:25,440
They have HP.

3768
04:33:29,670 --> 04:33:31,930
I'm curious to see what their attacks do to me.

3769
04:33:32,590 --> 04:33:33,970
But I don't want to get hit by it.

3770
04:33:42,180 --> 04:33:43,540
Wait, is this not staying lit?

3771
04:33:44,520 --> 04:33:45,800
After I explore?

3772
04:33:45,960 --> 04:33:46,800
Okay, it is, I think.

3773
04:33:49,900 --> 04:33:50,860
That's something, at least.

3774
04:34:00,410 --> 04:34:01,730
Oh, man, this is so wild.

3775
04:34:03,050 --> 04:34:06,270
