3776
04:34:07,810 --> 04:34:08,370
Is that a spider?

3777
04:34:08,790 --> 04:34:09,230
It is!

3778
04:34:09,730 --> 04:34:10,130
Oh, man.

3779
04:34:11,410 --> 04:34:12,190
Two of them, too.

3780
04:34:14,670 --> 04:34:15,110
Oh!

3781
04:34:17,030 --> 04:34:17,470
Gracias!

3782
04:34:19,970 --> 04:34:21,090
Oh, there's lava there.

3783
04:34:25,660 --> 04:34:26,900
That's so weird.

3784
04:34:30,340 --> 04:34:30,740
Oh, shit.

3785
04:34:31,980 --> 04:34:33,000
Gotta have an escape route.

3786
04:34:35,970 --> 04:34:42,110
The good news is the spiders seem to be weirdly indifferent to me, and they just sort of happen to go towards me sometimes.

3787
04:34:42,290 --> 04:34:46,570
I mean, they aggro on me, but it's not a, like, serious aggro.

3788
04:34:46,770 --> 04:34:49,250
It's just sort of weird.

3789
04:34:51,410 --> 04:34:52,110
Okay, one down.

3790
04:34:53,290 --> 04:34:53,790
Good stuff.

3791
04:35:01,540 --> 04:35:01,760
Nice!

3792
04:35:03,360 --> 04:35:04,340
Don't fuck with me!

3793
04:35:08,940 --> 04:35:10,680
Now, I haven't gotten a name for this place.

3794
04:35:19,760 --> 04:35:20,760
Uh, spiders come out of that.

3795
04:35:20,880 --> 04:35:21,740
