3796
04:35:29,370 --> 04:35:30,450
Oh, man, this is scary.

3797
04:35:31,770 --> 04:35:31,870
Oh!

3798
04:35:32,550 --> 04:35:33,010
Oh, no.

3799
04:35:34,750 --> 04:35:36,150
He was one of those teleport people.

3800
04:35:44,720 --> 04:35:45,280
You bastard!

3801
04:35:52,500 --> 04:35:54,020
