3802
04:35:56,560 --> 04:35:57,820
Keep the lights going.

3803
04:36:00,480 --> 04:36:01,080
Destroy this thing.

3804
04:36:04,080 --> 04:36:05,180
Yeah, fuck yeah.

3805
04:36:08,550 --> 04:36:09,050
Whoa!

3806
04:36:10,490 --> 04:36:11,530
Kill him, kill him!

